<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">{Devil Attacks!</font>

27
00:01:50,420 --> 00:01:51,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Crap!</font>

28
00:01:54,420 --> 00:01:56,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter how many times you try...</font>

29
00:01:59,390 --> 00:02:00,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's the same!</font>

30
00:02:19,910 --> 00:02:21,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll acknowledge you.</font>

31
00:02:21,870 --> 00:02:24,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're not only sharp...</font>

32
00:02:24,240 --> 00:02:26,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're also very determined...</font>

33
00:02:28,250 --> 00:02:30,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In addition, I'm nice too...</font>

34
00:02:32,380 --> 00:02:37,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Striking a helpless woman
is against my policy...</font>

35
00:02:37,720 --> 00:02:38,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But however I look at it,</font>

36
00:02:38,840 --> 00:02:41,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you don't have the feel of
a helpless woman...</font>

37
00:02:42,890 --> 00:02:44,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in your case!</font>

38
00:02:52,610 --> 00:02:54,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be getting full of yourself</font>

39
00:02:54,190 --> 00:02:57,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">just because you released
the Genjutsu, you idiot...!</font>

40
00:02:59,400 --> 00:03:01,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's still not completely bound.</font>

41
00:03:01,660 --> 00:03:02,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it...</font>

42
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:05,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't lose!</font>

43
00:03:12,040 --> 00:03:13,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A little more...</font>

44
00:03:33,900 --> 00:03:36,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What Chakra she has?!</font>

45
00:03:36,440 --> 00:03:38,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if I bind her
at point-blank range</font>

46
00:03:38,150 --> 00:03:40,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">she still pushes back...</font>

47
00:03:41,150 --> 00:03:44,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I'll get hammered
for sure if I let go now.</font>

48
00:03:46,700 --> 00:03:50,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After all, I just have to put this
to rest with this Jutsu.</font>

49
00:04:18,020 --> 00:04:20,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hang in there, Akamaru!</font>

50
00:04:55,310 --> 00:04:58,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it... What's going on?!</font>

51
00:05:28,180 --> 00:05:29,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

52
00:05:44,940 --> 00:05:47,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One more... to go...</font>

53
00:05:48,820 --> 00:05:51,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy's crazy strong...</font>

54
00:05:53,740 --> 00:05:57,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not a single hit with that
many shadow clones...</font>

55
00:05:58,580 --> 00:05:59,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's about time...</font>

56
00:06:00,920 --> 00:06:02,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've been eagerly waiting.</font>

57
00:06:06,130 --> 00:06:10,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru-sama's ambition...
The first step...</font>

58
00:07:00,020 --> 00:07:01,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke...</font>

59
00:07:07,440 --> 00:07:11,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke! What're you doing
with these guys?!</font>

60
00:07:11,910 --> 00:07:14,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come on! We're going home now!</font>

61
00:07:19,250 --> 00:07:20,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke...</font>

62
00:07:21,170 --> 00:07:22,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey...</font>

63
00:07:34,100 --> 00:07:35,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Should we go home?</font>

64
00:07:35,600 --> 00:07:36,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah!</font>

65
00:07:38,180 --> 00:07:41,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We've both made it to the top!</font>

66
00:07:43,730 --> 00:07:46,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to fight you too.</font>

67
00:07:49,650 --> 00:07:52,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey... We're going home.</font>

68
00:07:55,570 --> 00:07:58,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone's worried about you.</font>

69
00:08:00,750 --> 00:08:01,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So...</font>

70
00:08:11,470 --> 00:08:13,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke!</font>

71
00:08:13,380 --> 00:08:17,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please. Bring back Sasuke-kun...!</font>

72
00:08:18,100 --> 00:08:20,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can hear my voice, can't you?!</font>

73
00:08:27,440 --> 00:08:28,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait, Sasuke!</font>

74
00:08:33,240 --> 00:08:34,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's futile...</font>

75
00:08:37,030 --> 00:08:37,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Die.</font>

76
00:08:46,420 --> 00:08:47,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who're you?</font>

77
00:08:51,550 --> 00:08:52,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The rejuvenated...</font>

78
00:08:54,220 --> 00:08:56,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leaf Village's Handsome Devil...</font>

79
00:09:03,810 --> 00:09:05,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rock Lee!</font>

80
00:09:24,960 --> 00:09:26,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">B-Bushy Brow...?</font>

81
00:09:31,670 --> 00:09:33,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bushy Brow, you!
What about your body...?</font>

82
00:09:34,130 --> 00:09:36,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More importantly, Naruto-kun.
Go get Sasuke-kun.</font>

83
00:09:38,140 --> 00:09:39,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... you...</font>

84
00:09:40,890 --> 00:09:44,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please leave this person to me!</font>

85
00:09:48,350 --> 00:09:51,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy's... good...</font>

86
00:09:52,230 --> 00:09:56,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bushy Brow! Be careful!
He uses his own bones to attack.</font>

87
00:10:04,370 --> 00:10:07,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bones... you say...?</font>

88
00:10:10,040 --> 00:10:13,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's crazy strong...</font>

89
00:10:23,930 --> 00:10:26,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you doing?!
Please go quickly!</font>

90
00:10:27,430 --> 00:10:28,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun...</font>

91
00:10:29,060 --> 00:10:32,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You also promised Sakura-san
with a "nice-guy pose", right?!</font>

92
00:10:35,860 --> 00:10:38,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll bring back Sasuke no matter what!</font>

93
00:10:39,030 --> 00:10:41,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a promise of a lifetime!</font>

94
00:10:42,200 --> 00:10:45,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This person... I'll beat him!</font>

95
00:10:47,330 --> 00:10:48,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I promise!</font>

96
00:10:51,670 --> 00:10:52,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right!</font>

97
00:10:57,010 --> 00:10:58,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let you!</font>

98
00:11:04,640 --> 00:11:05,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Die.</font>

99
00:11:09,270 --> 00:11:11,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please don't ignore me!</font>

100
00:11:12,690 --> 00:11:13,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh...</font>

101
00:11:17,740 --> 00:11:18,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bushy Brow...</font>

102
00:11:20,030 --> 00:11:22,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't have the time
to be inattentive!</font>

103
00:11:25,740 --> 00:11:27,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good response!</font>

104
00:11:49,930 --> 00:11:50,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However...</font>

105
00:11:51,770 --> 00:11:54,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If Sasuke is inside that coffin...</font>

106
00:11:56,150 --> 00:12:00,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It'd be totally impossible to take them
on with a Genin team...</font>

107
00:12:01,860 --> 00:12:05,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We Jonin are in this plight...</font>

108
00:12:06,080 --> 00:12:10,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We should organize a special team
and send them out for backup.</font>

109
00:12:11,330 --> 00:12:12,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We can't do that...</font>

110
00:12:14,380 --> 00:12:16,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ever since Orochimaru's attack,</font>

111
00:12:16,880 --> 00:12:20,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Leaf is currently losing strength
as a great land.</font>

112
00:12:22,010 --> 00:12:24,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You understand that the Jonin
and Chunin are being totally mobilized</font>

113
00:12:25,050 --> 00:12:28,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in order to take out possible domestic
and international dangers.</font>

114
00:12:32,940 --> 00:12:37,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if the Sharingan were to fall
into Orochimaru's hands...</font>

115
00:12:39,900 --> 00:12:43,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We should now prioritize
avoiding war with other lands.</font>

116
00:12:44,280 --> 00:12:50,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... I'm sure the Orochimaru situation
isn't a problem that can be deferred forever.</font>

117
00:12:50,830 --> 00:12:54,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If he regains power...
He'll promptly attack again...</font>

118
00:12:55,420 --> 00:12:56,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know...</font>

119
00:12:57,330 --> 00:13:00,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not such a fool.</font>

120
00:13:02,210 --> 00:13:05,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was sure to think about it and
measures have already been taken.</font>

121
00:13:09,930 --> 00:13:10,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In here!</font>

122
00:13:20,150 --> 00:13:22,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's wrong, Guy?
You're on the brink of exhaustion.</font>

123
00:13:22,900 --> 00:13:24,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did something happen
on your mission?</font>

124
00:13:24,320 --> 00:13:29,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No... I took care of the mission
and ran back with all of my might...</font>

125
00:13:32,040 --> 00:13:33,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More importantly...</font>

126
00:13:35,040 --> 00:13:39,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee! What happened with
Lee's surgery?!</font>

127
00:13:45,510 --> 00:13:46,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was a success.</font>

128
00:13:48,470 --> 00:13:52,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He can start training starting tomorrow
if it's just for Jutsu.</font>

129
00:13:56,640 --> 00:14:01,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, bed rest for a while
would be best though.</font>

130
00:14:01,480 --> 00:14:03,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Th-There's trouble, Fifth Hokage-sama.</font>

131
00:14:04,320 --> 00:14:07,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rock Lee is gone!</font>

132
00:14:10,950 --> 00:14:14,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No!</font>

133
00:14:42,190 --> 00:14:45,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Next will be the end.</font>

134
00:14:54,540 --> 00:14:59,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it... Last night while
I treated Genma and Raido?</font>

135
00:15:01,710 --> 00:15:02,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee...</font>

136
00:15:07,800 --> 00:15:11,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That fool... He went after them.</font>

137
00:15:16,350 --> 00:15:19,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And... he must've been really flustered...</font>

138
00:15:26,230 --> 00:15:30,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He took my bottle of alcohol for
a bottle of medicine by mistake...</font>

139
00:15:31,820 --> 00:15:36,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}SAKE</b></font>

140
00:15:46,300 --> 00:15:47,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Alcohol?!</font>

141
00:15:51,130 --> 00:15:52,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh... Uh-oh...</font>

142
00:15:54,680 --> 00:15:55,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's wrong, Guy?</font>

143
00:15:58,720 --> 00:16:03,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Actually when Lee drinks even
a little bit of alcohol...</font>

144
00:16:09,400 --> 00:16:13,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Things get... so messy...</font>

145
00:16:13,820 --> 00:16:15,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get so messy?</font>

146
00:16:17,030 --> 00:16:19,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Severe Leaf Hurricane!</font>

147
00:16:39,100 --> 00:16:42,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's agile... My kicks don't hit.</font>

148
00:16:43,690 --> 00:16:45,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're flexible to
a surprising extent...</font>

149
00:16:45,400 --> 00:16:48,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And you make unique movements, eh?</font>

150
00:16:49,400 --> 00:16:53,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're too... straightforward.</font>

151
00:17:00,580 --> 00:17:01,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's over...</font>

152
00:17:03,370 --> 00:17:04,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please wait!</font>

153
00:17:14,760 --> 00:17:18,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry.
It's about time for my medicine!</font>

154
00:17:18,430 --> 00:17:20,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have to be sure to drink it so...</font>

155
00:17:20,430 --> 00:17:21,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Excuse me a moment.</font>

156
00:17:30,980 --> 00:17:34,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've always disliked medicine.</font>

157
00:17:39,580 --> 00:17:44,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It... happened before when
I took him to a restaurant</font>

158
00:17:44,250 --> 00:17:46,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to celebrate his acquisition
of the "Hidden Lotus."</font>

159
00:17:48,040 --> 00:17:51,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee mistook my alcohol for water...</font>

160
00:17:54,300 --> 00:17:57,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As soon as he drank just
a small cup...</font>

161
00:18:00,390 --> 00:18:03,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">of the alcohol things got ugly...</font>

162
00:18:04,060 --> 00:18:05,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Got ugly...?</font>

163
00:18:11,150 --> 00:18:13,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After a silence that was like
right before a storm...</font>

164
00:18:21,030 --> 00:18:22,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The moment I realized it</font>

165
00:18:23,870 --> 00:18:24,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the restaurant...</font>

166
00:18:27,040 --> 00:18:28,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">had gotten all messed up...</font>

167
00:18:32,130 --> 00:18:35,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Medicine always tastes stran...</font>

168
00:18:47,100 --> 00:18:51,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...? What did this guy drink?</font>

169
00:18:54,440 --> 00:18:57,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Messed up?
What do you mean?</font>

170
00:18:58,030 --> 00:19:01,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's terribly....!</font>

171
00:19:03,780 --> 00:19:06,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama... Lee goes into</font>

172
00:19:08,790 --> 00:19:11,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">an incredible drunken frenzy!</font>

173
00:19:12,670 --> 00:19:13,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh...?</font>

174
00:19:23,510 --> 00:19:26,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who the hell are you?! Hey!</font>

175
00:19:27,100 --> 00:19:30,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez, who are you anyway?</font>

176
00:19:30,270 --> 00:19:33,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Acting cool... So irritating...</font>

177
00:19:35,900 --> 00:19:39,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hence he's a natural user of...</font>

178
00:19:55,540 --> 00:19:57,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Drunken Fist!</font>

